{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2023-02-06 15:27:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. NAMED A TOP WORKPLACE IN THE USA', 'text': 'COMPANY RANKS ON TOP LIST IN ATLANTA FOR 7TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR ATLANTA , FEB. 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE: ROL), A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES COMPANY HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS A TOP WORKPLACE ON BOTH A NATIONAL AND LOCAL LEVEL.\xa0THIS MARKS THE SEVENTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR TO BE RECOGNIZED IN ATLANTA.'}